    "detailed_description": "Explore forgotten land, climb on structures, view the scenery and interact with NPCs and environment to discover secrets and more fun facts from most recent campaign from BaniakBaniaka.<br />\r\nPlay this single person mode game walking simulator and spend time exploring the environment to find interactive items that provide more context on world or characters.<br />\r\nUse free view to take screenshots of locations. Follow simple quests, ride a mule.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is in early stages of production, more content will follow with future updates.<br />\r\nStep into the epic world of &quot;Kharakow,&quot; a fan-made game brought to life by the passionate creators of the Albion Forge.<br />\r\nInspired by the gripping RPG campaign &quot;Wydaleni&quot; hosted on the popular polish YouTube channel Baniak Baniaka, this game is a tribute to the dwarven residents of Kharakow.",
